4sn96k4.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXerreZF-w_text","label":"ggXerreZF-w_text","default":"<strong>By Dr. James Caldwell,</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYc8Ukovm3_text","label":"ggYc8Ukovm3_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">Testosterone Specialist</span><br>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNKqQ5JGd8_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggNKqQ5JGd8_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_96k4sn96k4sn96k4.png"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0wZ499PHU_text","label":"gg0wZ499PHU_text","default":"By Dr. James Caldwell / <span style=\"color:#62638E;\">Testosterone Specialist&nbsp;</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_RrMh1yDS_text","label":"gg_RrMh1yDS_text","default":"<p>328,490 Views</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguAAQa34LU_text","label":"gguAAQa34LU_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:15px;\">There's a specific moment where you feel it happen.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:15px;\">Not nerves. Not \"in your head.\"</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:15px;\">A wall — right when it matters most.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:15px;\">You used to have control. <strong>Now you're finishing before you want to</strong>, before she wants you to, and you don't know why.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:15px;\">You already know the moment I'm describing.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:15px;\">Same feeling.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:15px;\">Every single time.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:15px;\"><strong>Here's what most men miss:</strong> that moment didn't start in the bedroom.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:15px;\"><strong>It started at 8am. With the cup you trusted most.</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5CwhWqvad_text","label":"gg5CwhWqvad_text","default":"<span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17pt;\"><strong>The Thing You Drink To Feel Sharper Is Quietly Destroying Your Cortisol&nbsp;</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUxm6uxFjj_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggUxm6uxFjj_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/ALPHA_BREW_copy.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUxm6uxFjj_srcSet_mobile_src","label":"ggUxm6uxFjj_srcSet_mobile_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/4_5a87c5c4-1025-42a4-9ab0-6f007b03907e.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOovp2jBmw_text","label":"ggOovp2jBmw_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Researchers spent years studying testosterone decline in men who were technically healthy</strong>.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Normal sleep. Normal diet.&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Testosterone levels that looked fine on paper.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">But every symptom of low T was there. The rushed feeling. The disconnection. The lack of control that arrived like clockwork.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">They controlled for stress. They controlled for sleep quality. They even controlled for relationship satisfaction.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">The variable that kept surfacing wasn't what these men were doing wrong in the moment.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">It was what they were doing every morning without questioning it.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">In a 2019 study published in [Journal], researchers tracked men's hormone levels across different caffeine intake patterns.&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>What they found was stark: </strong>higher caffeine consumption was associated with significantly elevated cortisol levels and measurably lower free testosterone.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Not total T. Free T. The testosterone that governs control, stamina, and staying present.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">And here's the mechanism most men never see.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Caffeine from regular coffee triggers a cortisol spike within 30 minutes.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">That cortisol elevation suppresses your HPG axis — the hormonal signal chain responsible for testosterone production.&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Chronic cortisol elevation directly interferes with luteinizing hormone secretion, the upstream trigger your body needs to produce testosterone.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Less signal = less control. More anxiety = more overthinking. More overthinking = finishing faster.</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">You're in a loop. And every cup deepens it.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRDmggoJqj_text","label":"ggRDmggoJqj_text","default":"<span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17pt;\"><strong>This Is Why Most Solutions Don't Touch The Real Problem</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-mpw0vwQE_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg-mpw0vwQE_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/6_edbb4fbf-f57b-4c4c-8e6c-24d9b1aa091e.png"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-mpw0vwQE_srcSet_mobile_src","label":"gg-mpw0vwQE_srcSet_mobile_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/6_edbb4fbf-f57b-4c4c-8e6c-24d9b1aa091e.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbfikHMutm_text","label":"ggbfikHMutm_text","default":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">You've probably already tried something.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Distraction techniques.</strong> Stop-and-start methods. A spray or a pill that numbed more than it helped.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">And it either did nothing or made things worse.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Here's why:</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Numbing sprays remove sensation without touching the actual cause — you're not solving the control problem, you're just muting it.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Mental tricks work around the anxiety without touching what's driving it hormonally.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">T boosters try to raise testosterone without removing the cortisol ceiling suppressing it. The hormone rises. Cortisol pushes it back down.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>&nbsp;The cycle continues.</strong></span></p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">So you conclude this is just how you are.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">That conclusion makes sense.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">It's also wrong.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjosjER4wf_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggjosjER4wf_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0653/0908/1645/files/Copy_of_Frosted_Files_Volume_3_1080x1080_copy_4_3933a118-20a0-4d2b-ad74-682412167f24.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWgc9ih4nO_label","label":"ggWgc9ih4nO_label","default":"<p>CHECK AVAILABILITY</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcDqqX0uGI_childItem_0","label":"ggcDqqX0uGI_childItem_0","default":"<p>90-day money back guarantee</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gggoUwErF79_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gggoUwErF79_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://placehold.co/2048x2048?text=Image"},{"type":"html","id":"gg41GfpX_bz_text","label":"gg41GfpX_bz_text","default":"<p>Reserve a Sproutly Pouch</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWRFUQh41l_label","label":"ggWRFUQh41l_label","default":"<p>Jo